### Simple Country API Tests

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/countries

### 1. Get all countries
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Get country by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 3. Create new country
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Country",
  "isoCode": "TST",
  "currency": "TST"
}

### 4. Update country
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Country",
  "isoCode": "USA",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 5. Delete country
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/2